--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9c94e8900bdbef942ad19f626cdac685, type: 3}
  m_Name: Horizontal_Scene6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sceneHeader: Scene 6
  sceneSubHeader: Releasing Insulin
  NarrationBeats:
  - narrationText: "An insulin vesicle is a membrane enclosed bubble within the cell
      that holds large amounts of insulin in a crystalline form. \r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1035168072
        Data2: 1309097444
        Data3: 844663684
        Data4: 873121595
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_01
  - narrationText: "They change over time, but eventually dock themselves to the
      underside of the cell\u2019s membrane when they are fully mature. \r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1189403106
        Data2: 1149357651
        Data3: 1391732629
        Data4: -1072388329
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_02
  - narrationText: "As the cAMP proliferates throughout the beta cell, it triggers
      processes that activate SNARE proteins holding the docked insulin vesicles
      in place.\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 790257183
        Data2: 1235976881
        Data3: -1548128096
        Data4: -204916914
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_03
  - narrationText: "The SNARE complexes embedded on both the cell and insulin vesicle
      membranes twist and intertwine, fusing the two membranes together. \r\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -674827841
        Data2: 1273219316
        Data3: -1219989574
        Data4: -90050887
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_04
  - narrationText: "Then the SNARE protein strands pull apart, forming a tunnel between
      the interior pocket of the vesicle and the turbulent world outside of the cell.\r
      \r\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1132601054
        Data2: 1160688956
        Data3: 288585405
        Data4: 1721940029
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_05
  - narrationText: "The fluid environment inside the insulin vesicle changes instantly,
      and the insulin crystal begins to dissolve.\r\r \r\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1404320212
        Data2: 1097336681
        Data3: -15550041
        Data4: -768720208
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_06
  - narrationText: "Layers of insulin hexamers begin shedding off the crystal and
      get siphoned into the whirlpool of interstitial fluid beyond the beta cell.
      \r\r\r \r\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -46046166
        Data2: 1300018713
        Data3: 628206720
        Data4: 101599695
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_07
  - narrationText: "As they leave, the insulin hexamers dissolve further, breaking
      up into dimer pairs and then individual active insulin monomers.\r\r\r\r \r\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -810662857
        Data2: 1306575262
        Data3: 1883880358
        Data4: -647533544
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_08
  - narrationText: "Streams of insulin monomers flow out from fused insulin vesicles
      along the cell\u2019s surface and are carried away to their destiny by the
      bloodstream.\r\r\r\r\r \r\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 163318299
        Data2: 1161537798
        Data3: -809359486
        Data4: -1538911123
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_09
  - narrationText: "The signal is sent and insulin is on its way.\r\r\r\r\r\r \r\r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -84793040
        Data2: 1270497492
        Data3: -1393943110
        Data4: -75048412
      Path: event:/VO/scene_06_10
